<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<title>Run it — Dunlin</title>
<meta name="description" content="Run Dunlin 3 on your own machine, with no account and no key: Ollama, Python, Hugging Face, llama.cpp, LM Studio or a server.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Run it — Dunlin">
